        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton EN-1803, 18 Inch Single Cylinder Mortise Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handsome square handleset is made of solid bronze. With such a beautiful bronze patina finish, it will add an elegance to any home. Measuring 18 inches long, this mortise lockset is a single cylinder operated by a key from the outside and a thumb-turn from the inside. Available with your choice of inside lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The covered deadbolt is operated by key outside, thumbturn inside; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob inside and a thumbpiece outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: matching <a href=\"/products/s-grip-18-inch-dummy-handleset-hamilton-en-1803d\"><b>18 Inch S-Grip Dummy Handleset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Hamilton Sinkler EN-1803 Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made with traditional high end high quality craftsmanship.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch face and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li>Made of authentic solid bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes:mortise lock body with face plate, lock cylinder, interior thumbturn, strike plate and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Decorative 18 Inch Single Cylinder Mortise Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Bronze Patina</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 18\"</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 6-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a single cylinder mortise lockset--it does NOT fit a standard 2-1/8\" pre drilled door. The deadbolt on this single cylinder handleset is thrown and retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This is  discontinued.</b> \r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
